Your physical form is but a mere extension of your mind, you can bend it at will for [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

While under the effect you gain [12%, 21%, 28%, 34%, 40% (TL1-5)] all resistances and have [12%, 18%, 22%, 26%, 30% (TL1-5)] chance to ignore all critical hits.

On activation you also remove up to [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5)] physical or mental effects.
